#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "Makani is a refined, minimalist block theme for a personal website or portfolio. A calm homepage is ready right after activation: an introduction with an arch-shaped portrait, about section with quick facts, selected work gallery, services list, latest blog posts and a contact section. Light Geist typography, small monospaced labels, hairline details, a white and a dark (Ink) style. Made for photographers, designers, writers, freelancers and creatives — edit everything in the Site Editor, no code required."
msgstr ""

