#: patterns/about.php:32
msgid "Born in Honolulu and based in Madrid since 2016, I work between the Atlantic islands, Southern Europe and wherever an assignment takes me. I believe the best images come from time spent, not time saved: I stay longer, return often and let the story set the pace."
msgstr ""

